!Lojbanic Forums
This page contains a list of various forums in which people discuss Lojban or discuss in Lojban.

Naturally, some of these are more popular than others.  If you're looking for a quick answer to a question, or someone to speak to live in Lojban, the Freenode IRC channel continues to be your best bet.  If you want a more authoritative answer, or to reach a larger number of people at once, you're probably best off writing to the mailing list.  But these days many of the other forums listed below do have significant traffic.

!! Mailing Lists{ANAME()}lists{ANAME}
Subscribe to the mailing lists with the [http://www.lojban.org/lsg2/|the lojban.org mailing list interface].

__Google Groups__: If you do not want to access the lists via email, you can use the web interface on Google Groups.
* [http://groups.google.com/group/lojban/topics|Lojban General Mailing List]
* [http://groups.google.com/group/lojban-beginners/topics|Lojban Beginners Mailing List]

__Old Forum Interface__: [http://www.lojban.org/tiki/forum5|The Lojban In General Web Forum] was a two-way mirror of the main mailing list. It is now locked.
*  Lojbanists primarily talk to each other and keep abreast of developments on the [http://www.lojban.org/lists/lojban-list|Lojban mailing list].
*  Beginners can get their questions answered on the [http://wiki.lojban.org/index.php?Beginner%27s%20Mailing%20List|Beginner's Mailing List].
*  le jbocertu cu bau casnu vecu'u [http://groups.yahoo.com/group/jbosnu|la jbosnu]{ANAME()}jbosnu{ANAME}
*  The [http://www.lojban.org/lists/jboske|jboske, or lojbanic science] list is for extremely detailed discussions of technical and linguistic issues related to Lojban.
    
